    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/5fc63c0ab7b488471cf57b286dd7d1cd.avif?t=1743246253\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to unravel the mysteries of The Anomaly Project!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU AND YOUR TEAM FIGURE OUT WHATS OUT OF THE ORDINARY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/b1c298a1b815977acadd9545c6c03409.poster.avif?t=1743246253\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/b1c298a1b815977acadd9545c6c03409.webm?t=1743246253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/b1c298a1b815977acadd9545c6c03409.mp4?t=1743246253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/cf0a1b1d14708d530c88a6626b86f147.avif?t=1743246253\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VanossGaming\u00a0\u2022 KYRSP33DY\u00a0\u2022 Forsen</strong>\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Yogscast</strong> \u2022 H2ODelirious \u2022 Terroriser \u2022 Nogla\u00a0\u2022 BasicallyIDoWork \u2022 Lui Calibe\u00a0\u2022\u00a08-BitRyan\u00a0\u2022 CaRtOoNz\u00a0\u2022 TheDeluxe4\u00a0\u2022  Elraenn\u00a0\u2022 SideArms4Reason\u00a0\u2022 ChilledChaosGAME\u00a0\u2022 Hat Films\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Kilira Cooper\u00a0\u2022 Nino MssClick\u00a0\u2022\u00a0luthfi halimawan\u00a0\u2022 Jeni Gaming\u00a0\u2022\u00a0<strong>And many more...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/c8f49e09a52028e9aa645db0c04766e5.avif?t=1743246253\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Anomaly Project you and <strong>co-players</strong> have to <strong>try and escape</strong> by noticing <strong>Anomalies</strong> and making the decision to go in either the Red tube or the Green tube. If you have decided correctly you progress to the next level. Otherwise you are reset to the first level. Will you ever escape...? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/2e0d0c5169ef06843d0f6afa8b2993e4.avif?t=1743246253\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1-8 player online co-op</strong><br>Explore a multiplayer experience with up to 8 players. Communicate and help each other through <strong>text chat</strong> or <strong>proximity voice chat</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get to the exit</strong> <br>Navigating through the levels, some more mysterious than others, you'll encounter anomalies that defy logic and reason. Keep your senses sharp as you search for hidden clues and spot anomalies to get closer towards escaping at Level 10</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/34ebbe11cb5bdb8f03a3e4fb7f61d2cb.avif?t=1743246253\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-8 player online co-op</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Socialize with friends or strangers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chat &amp; Voicechat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in a liminal space atmospheres</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get frightened, jumpscares</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Finding anomalies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 Anomaly maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLINKO!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE MULTIPLE MAPS, WITH EACH THEIR OWN THEMES AND CHALLENGING ANOMALIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/3e33165588c2a6a006528c4b585e06f8.poster.avif?t=1743246253\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/3e33165588c2a6a006528c4b585e06f8.webm?t=1743246253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/3e33165588c2a6a006528c4b585e06f8.mp4?t=1743246253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOME ANOMALIES ARE CRAZIER THAN OTHERS... OH YEAH, BE CAREFULL OF JUMPSCARES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/30fbf8fdb48ae37b1d07b1fabf0c32f7.poster.avif?t=1743246253\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960770/extras/30fbf8fdb48ae37b1d07b1fabf0c32f7.webm?t=1743246253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam